alogs":[{"nodeId":736740101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":3602028362,"text":"ちびっこ、お前が俺を連れて来たんだろ？ほら、動けよ。","nextNodeIds":[736740102]},{"nodeId":736740102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1694749394,"text":"はぁ、もういい。お前はそこでじっとしてろ…","nextNodeIds":[736740103,736740104]},{"nodeId":736740103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3078478098,"text":"何してるの？","nextNodeIds":[736740106]},{"nodeId":736740106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":738571218,"text":"はぁ、今回もまたちびっこにやられた…最初から話そう。","nextNodeIds":[736740107]},{"nodeId":736740107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2579562266,"text":"信じられないかもしれないが、俺は不思議と仙霊を引き付けやすい体質みたいなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[736740108]},{"nodeId":736740108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1267286802,"text":"そして俺についてくる仙霊の中に、宝探しにハマっている仙霊がいることに気がついた。","nextNodeIds":[736740109]},{"nodeId":736740109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":362311314,"text":"名前を付けるのは苦手だから、やつらのことは「宝探し仙霊」と呼んでる。","nextNodeIds":[736740110]},{"nodeId":736740110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1209996098,"text":"やつらは宝探しが得意なんだ。おかげで俺も結構な数の宝を見つけて、少しは儲けることができた。","nextNodeIds":[736740111]},{"nodeId":736740111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":620942914,"text":"だが、急に反応しなくなることもある。宝探しに疲れたのか、俺をつまらない奴だと思ったのか、理由はわからないが…","nextNodeIds":[736740112]},{"nodeId":736740112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":7509794,"text":"そういう時は、仙霊が気に入る人間を探して協力してもらうんだ。","nextNodeIds":[736740113]},{"nodeId":736740113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2968987234,"text":"そいつに「宝探し仙霊」を連れて宝物を探させて、俺は…見つかった宝を売って利益を出すって寸法だ。","nextNodeIds":[736740114]},{"nodeId":736740114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":3764186802,"text":"スメールには至る所に遺跡があって、骨董品で溢れていると聞いたから、ここでも一儲けしようと思ったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[736740115]},{"nodeId":736740115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":4012313018,"text":"スメールに来てみたら、案の定たくさんの仙霊たちが寄ってきて、その中にいた「宝探し仙霊」が俺をここまで連れてきてくれた。","nextNodeIds":[736740116]},{"nodeId":736740116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2695938994,"text":"なのに、地面を掘り始めて少し経ったと思ったら、またちびっこが俺に反応しなくなってしまって…","nextNodeIds":[736740117]},{"nodeId":736740117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":4070332042,"text":"ん？どうして急に動き出したんだ？まさか…","nextNodeIds":[736740118]},{"nodeId":736740118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1106509378,"text":"旅人、仙霊と一緒に宝探しをすることに興味はないか？","nextNodeIds":[736740119,736740120]},{"nodeId":736740119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3571347370,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}が？","nextNodeIds":[736740121]},{"nodeId":736740121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2437879162,"text":"話す必要はない。ただそいつに付いて行って、止まったら地面を掘ればいいんだ。簡単だろ？","nextNodeIds":[736740122]},{"nodeId":736740122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":3605320458,"text":"どうだ、試してみないか？そうだな…もし本当に宝物が見つかったら、俺は「古鉄銭」だけ貰えればいい。他は全部お前のものだ！","nextNodeIds":[736740123]},{"nodeId":736740123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":769376722,"text":"それだけじゃない。お前が本当に「古鉄銭」を見つけることができたら、それに応じた報酬を支払う。","nextNodeIds":[736740124,736740126]},{"nodeId":736740124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4283814426,"text":"試してみる。","nextNodeIds":[736740125]},{"nodeId":736740125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":144789074,"text":"話が早いな！お前みたいな奴は好きだ！","nextNodeIds":[736740130]},{"nodeId":736740130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2904946714,"text":"とにかく、俺たちは今から協力関係だ！","nextNodeIds":[736740131]},{"nodeId":736740131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2534556418,"text":"このノートを持っていけ。これには、前に見つけて掘らずにおいた宝蔵地が書いてある。","nextNodeIds":[736740132]},{"nodeId":736740132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2443193058,"text":"じゃあ頼んだぞ、旅人。もし「古鉄銭」を見つけたら、忘れずに持ってきてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":736740126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3765375282,"text":"「古鉄銭」ってなに？","nextNodeIds":[736740127]},{"nodeId":736740127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":697612538,"text":"端的に言えば、ある種の特別な骨董品だ。","nextNodeIds":[736740128]},{"nodeId":736740128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":242433842,"text":"コネさえあれば、この「古鉄銭」を使っていいものをたくさん手に入れられる。","nextNodeIds":[736740129]},{"nodeId":736740129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":3395136922,"text":"まあ…コネについては、まだ見当がついてないんだが…","nextNodeIds":[736740130]},{"nodeId":736740120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":127084162,"text":"仙霊の言葉がわからない…","nextNodeIds":[736740121]},{"nodeId":736740104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3193341018,"text":"これは…仙霊？","nextNodeIds":[736740105]},{"nodeId":736740105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1521978690,"text":"このちびっこのことか？ああ…まあ、そんな感じだ…","nextNodeIds":[736740106]}]},{"talkId":7367403,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"par