pHash":4239822882,"text":"ウルマン？","nextNodeIds":[736740305]},{"nodeId":736740305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1789300066,"text":"旅人？久しぶりだな。","nextNodeIds":[736740306]},{"nodeId":736740306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2804290922,"text":"調子はどうだ？まだ世界中を旅しているのか？お前の数多くの偉業は俺の耳にも入ってきている、流石だな。","nextNodeIds":[736740307]},{"nodeId":736740307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":1537319722,"text":"ははっ、今回スメールに来たのは、どんな問題を解決するためなんだ？","nextNodeIds":[736740308,736740310]},{"nodeId":736740308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":412779706,"text":"縁起の悪いことを言わないで。","nextNodeIds":[736740309]},{"nodeId":736740309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":821656786,"text":"わかったわかった、本題に入ろう。旅人、今回も俺に協力してくれないか？","nextNodeIds":[736740313]},{"nodeId":736740313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":4203373842,"text":"見ろ、このスメールの大地には、至る所に宝物やモラが隠されている。","nextNodeIds":[736740314]},{"nodeId":736740314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2746300042,"text":"俺の体質も…いつも通り働いてくれて、たくさんの仙霊を引き付けてる。その中には、俺たちに馴染みのある「宝探し仙霊」もいるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[736740315]},{"nodeId":736740315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2389034538,"text":"前と同じように、お前は宝を探して、俺はお前に報酬を用意するんだ。","nextNodeIds":[736740316]},{"nodeId":736740316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":3626597794,"text":"俺たちが手を組めば、絶対に大儲けできる！","nextNodeIds":[736740317,736740321]},{"nodeId":736740317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":962982578,"text":"今回も「鉄銭」を探すの？","nextNodeIds":[736740318]},{"nodeId":736740318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":815862858,"text":"いや、それは違う。今回は「鉄銭」よりも価値のある、「古鉄銭