[]},{"nodeId":736740321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1203260538,"text":"他の人を当たってみないの？","nextNodeIds":[736740322]},{"nodeId":736740322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":88662058,"text":"いやあ…協力相手となれば、自分が一番よく知っている人を選びたいに決まってるだろ。","nextNodeIds":[736740323]},{"nodeId":736740323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2901105530,"text":"それに、お前と俺の関係だからな。こんなにいい話があるってのに、お前以外に利益を譲るわけにはいかないだろ。","nextNodeIds":[736740324]},{"nodeId":736740324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2288527146,"text":"しばらく見ないうちに、お喋り上手になったね。","nextNodeIds":[736740325]},{"nodeId":736740325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":2407752906,"text":"へへへっ、宝物の買い手を探すには、まず話し方から勉強しないといけなかったからな。","nextNodeIds":[736740326]},{"nodeId":736740310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3310919034,"text":"#まずは{M#君}{F#あなた}を片付けてから。","nextNodeIds":[736740311]},{"nodeId":736740311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":378247530,"text":"ははは、よしてくれ。俺がお前の攻撃に耐えられるわけがないだろ。","nextNodeIds":[736740312]},{"nodeId":736740312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30038,"speakerName":"ウルマン","textMapHash":3547308034,"text":"真面目な話だ、旅人。今回も協力してくれないか？","nextNodeIds":[736740313]},{"nodeId":736740304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2594668506,"text":"どうしてここに？","nextNodeIds":[736740305]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7367401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7367403,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133302390"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["73674","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET